  "purpose": "The standard cell views this project's OWN design uses and library_sources.json does not carry. That file was assembled on 2026-08-20 for the two Phase A shuttle targets and its 43 views cover 35 of the 51 masters in dualarm/build_current's netlist. It is not reopened, because its numbers are quoted in A.3 and A.4. These sixteen are the remainder, from the same repository at the same commit, so that extraction/CELL_LIBRARY.json can cover the whole design and chip/armc_cost.py can stop carrying a hand-written table of output pin names.",
  "repo": {
    "commit": "ac7fb61f06e6470b94e8afdf7c25268f62fbd7b1",
    "licence": "Apache-2.0",
    "url": "https://github.com/google/skywater-pdk-libs-sky130_fd_sc_hd",
    "what": "Functional views of the sky130_fd_sc_hd cells. One per base cell: drive strength changes the transistors, not the pins or the function."
  },
